	(descr "Cinch/Johnson 142-0701-801 SMA end-launch jack, round contact, gold, 0.062 in (1.57 mm) board. Lands from the Emerson/Johnson end-launch drawing (inches): ground pads outer width D=0.440, inner gap C=0.250, depth E=0.200, on F.Cu and B.Cu at the board edge; center land width B=0.090 on F.Cu only. Stitch holes are the drawing's 2x 0.018 in drills with 0.038 in pads. Origin is the signal-land center. Body is local -Y; the board edge is at y=-2.54 mm.")
